sp}(2\\|2)$ | $n=1$ | $4 \\mid 4$ (total 8) | 64 | **PASSED** (0 failures) | 512 | 450 | **PASSED** (0 failures) |\n| $C(3) = \\mathfrak{osp}(2\\|4)$ | $n=2$ | $11 \\mid 8$ (total 19) | 361 | **PASSED** (0 failures) | 6,859 | 5,736 | **PASSED** (0 failures) |\n| $C(4) = \\mathfrak{osp}(2\\|6)$ | $n=3$ | $22 \\mid 12$ (total 34) | 1,156 | **PASSED** (0 failures) | 39,304 | 30,294 | **PASSED** (0 failures) |\n\n#### Execution Details:\n- **Anti-Symmetry**: $100\\%$ verified with zero discrepancies across all long roots, short roots, Cartan generators, and odd roots.\n- **Super Jacobi Identity**: Every triple in $\\mathfrak{g} \\times \\mathfrak{g} \\times \\mathfrak{g}$ (including all mixed even-even-even, even-even-odd, even-odd-odd, and odd-odd-odd triples) summed to zero identically using exact rational arithmetic.\n- **Automated Tests**: Added [`tests/test_verify_C_structure.py`](file://<home>/notebook/git/thm01-R/thm01-R-gemini38f-r2-F/tests/test_verify_C_structure.py). All 17 tests in the test suite pass.\n\n---\n\n### Overall Status: ALL CHECKS PASSED\n\nStanding by for your review and explicit approval before proceeding to Step 5.\n----- END OF WORKER REPLY -----"
